msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:21
#: 31e7c767882a48e4b0ccf860738af27b
msgid ""
"旧版卡没有显式滑移方向，因此仅凭 `近似晶面 h k l`（`hkl`）无法定义一个物理滑"
"移系。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:23
#: a3c4cdd233954487877b9d833de9eeff
msgid "旧算法实际做什么"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:25
#: bb4a40a25f584a9497f1a85d3eb045ae
msgid "给定输入晶胞 $A$ 和 `hkl=(h,k,l)`，旧算法先用倒易晶格构造单位法向："
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:27
#: 93ff2dad2b9c4c5cb962478d925493fb
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf n}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{h\\mathbf b_1+k\\mathbf b_2+l\\mathbf b_3}\n"
"{\\left|h\\mathbf b_1+k\\mathbf b_2+l\\mathbf b_3\\right|}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:34
#: f0ac8cdb44104ca69714b17b0a8a9803
msgid ""
"随后从全局笛卡尔 x、y、z 轴中选择与 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 最不平行的一根轴 $"
"\\mathbf e$，并定义："
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:36
#: d79985b96788467fa731fef0cfa17e89
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf s}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\times\\mathbf e}\n"
"{\\left|\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\times\\mathbf e\\right|}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:43
#: fd8e42d6a3154d9282b829fd06f1f8a4
msgid ""
"这个 $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ 是确定性的面内方向，但不是用户指定的晶向。只要它恰好"
"等于目标滑移方向，旧算法生成的结构可以是有效层错；否则结果只是另一个方向上的"
"层间错排。把同一物理晶体整体旋转后，所选方向还可能改变。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:45
#: 3f8f8342366048fba08c904120eb1ca1
msgid ""
"原子按投影 $q_i=\\mathbf r_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 排序。`旧版投影层序号`"
"（`layers`）选择第几个投影坐标作为阈值，并移动满足 $q_i\\ge q_\\mathrm{cut}$ "
"的原子。若 `旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）超出投影层数，算法静默改用中间投影层。"
"最后沿 $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ 施加绝对 Å 位移并把坐标折回周期晶胞。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:47
#: 30181648294540e680e52ee162ced217
msgid "因此旧卡的核心位移并非错误，但参数面不足以可靠表达任意滑移系："
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:49
#: 07176b5e61464fef8f5a5341d3206a29
msgid "默认 `layers=1` 可能选中全部原子，只产生整体平移，没有形成相对层移；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:50
#: 6787ad89f2894dc7b993cac6891aefb4
msgid "“层”由投影坐标四舍五入到 8 位后去重，不是带容差的晶体学层识别；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:51
#: c6e626797226431aa5a294576a078486
msgid "超范围层号不会报错，而会回退到中间层；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:52
#: 54dd11106a6f412e9085efd93bc30b20
msgid "`hkl=(0,0,0)` 会原样返回输入结构；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:53
#: 92ed3ebd9f024ea29df55f2090d4a84f
msgid "输出是否对应目标层错取决于自动方向是否恰好等于目标晶向；"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:54
#: 3f96a5fb813e45088c1aefdac481feef
msgid "卡片不检查输入晶胞是否已按目标晶面定向。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:56
#: c262dd0df40b439093a3647ced6ea2dd
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:58
#: 71092b25a1ec4d4891e2a6ee532df50e
msgid "近似晶面 h k l（hkl）"
msgstr "hkl"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:60
#: 5ed8156345e3403da64b749e3f937865
msgid ""
"长度为 3 的整数序列，默认 `(1,1,1)`。只用于构造投影法向，不足以定义物理滑移"
"系。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:62
#: 86b8f802523e4ffca41f46126ed82b1f
msgid "旧版投影层序号（layers）"
msgstr "layers"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:64
#: cc1f0b0e16be417eb50e6246b6728d51
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1，必须至少为 1。选择排序后的第 `旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）个投"
"影坐标作为移动阈值；并不是“参与层错的层数”。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:66
#: 2a54615e6a8343f3a7f5d770f955b613
msgid "位移（step）"
msgstr "step"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:68
#: 9a1e34c895f94fde8f55b8e7a3de6f93
msgid ""
"三个浮点数 `[start, stop, step]`，默认 `[0.0, 1.0, 0.5]`，单位 Å。每个值都是"
"沿旧算法自动选择的 $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ 的绝对位移。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:70
#: aa6d0d051662444d9259aa7061f7638b
msgid "兼容配置示例"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:72
#: a86675c1393d4a4fb58243471dde5caf
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StackingFaultCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"hkl\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"    \"step\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.5],\n"
"    \"layers\": 2\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:84
