msgid ""
"旧配置不能自动无损转换，因为其中没有记录滑移方向。迁移时需要根据材料和目标滑"
"移系人工确定 `slip_uvw`，并重新检查切面。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:90
#: cfa71d02ec6d4616bfa84040e8ddd4cc
